# Gauntlet: Dark Legacy (4D57000E), Thor. Authored by lane.titleroutes session
# 49, from the generic `--route survey` soak 0-0-s-1790823800-titleroutes-
# 2951589 (session 46, heat-stopped at 256/300s). That soak ran 14 blind
# START/A cycles (survey.route's default) and overshot: by the 8th cycle's
# A press (205704-menu-a.png) the wizard was already exploring the dungeon
# at live 14 fps, but cycles 9-14 kept pressing START during that live play,
# and the soak's own `mark play` frame landed on the in-game pause menu's
# Audio page (205824-play.png) -- the same START-during-gameplay trap found
# in sonic-heroes.route, this time caught in the survey's own frames before
# any route was committed.
#
# Fix: stop at 8 cycles (where the survey's own evidence shows gameplay
# already running under the intro scroll "I have summoned to my tower...")
# and never press START again after the mark, matching castlevania-cod.route.
# DRAFT until its own replay is checked.
wait 20
shot boot20
wait 20
shot boot40
wait 20
mark booted
repeat 8 {
    press START
    wait 5
    shot menu-start
    press A
    wait 5
    shot menu-a
}
wait 2
shot running
mark gameplay
repeat forever {
    axis LY min
    press A
    wait 3
    axis RX max
    wait 0.5
    axis RX mid
    axis LY mid
    wait 1
    shot play
}
